## Source location

Primary Hopper FA3 reference: **`/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/`**  
Key files: `tile_size.h`, `flash_fwd_launch_template.h`, `mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp`, `flash_fwd_kernel_sm90.h`, `tile_scheduler.hpp`, `epilogue_fwd.hpp`.

