## 2. Pipeline stages & Q buffering

**kStages = 2** on SM90, hardcoded (not from `tile_size_fwd_sm8x`):

```48:49:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_fwd_launch_template.h
    static constexpr int kStages = Arch >= 90 ? 2 : std::get<3>(kBlockMN_kNWarps_Stages_RS);
    static constexpr bool Q_in_regs = Arch >= 90 ? false : std::get<4>(kBlockMN_kNWarps_Stages_RS);
```

K/V are 2-stage pipelined:

```136:138:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
    using SmemLayoutK = decltype(tile_to_shape(
        SmemLayoutAtomK{},
        make_shape(shape<1>(TileShape_MNK{}), shape<2>(TileShape_MNK{}), Int<kStages>{})));
```

**Q is single-buffered in smem**, not multi-staged and not in registers:

```132:132:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
    using SmemLayoutQ = decltype(tile_to_shape(SmemLayoutAtomQ{}, select<0, 2>(TileShape_MNK{})));
```

```82:84:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
    // Register bandwidth is actually a bottleneck so we don't want Q to be in registers.
    static constexpr bool MmaQK_is_RS = false;
```

For FP8 with row-major V, an extra **`smem_vt`** staging buffer exists alongside **`smem_v`** (transpose path), still with `kStages` on the V pipelines.

