## 3. Tile scheduler & grid shape

SM90 persistent scheduling is enabled unless `Split && !Varlen`:

```77:78:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_fwd_launch_template.h
    static constexpr bool UsePersistentScheduler = Arch >= 90 ? !(Split && !Varlen) : ((Is_causal && !Varlen) || (Varlen && Split));
    using Scheduler = std::conditional_t<!UsePersistentScheduler, SchedulerSingleTile, SchedulerPersistent>;
```

Scheduler selection:

```65:70:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_fwd_launch_template.h
    using SchedulerPersistent = std::conditional_t<Varlen,
        flash::VarlenDynamicPersistentTileScheduler<...>,
        std::conditional_t<!Is_causal && !Is_local,
            flash::StaticPersistentTileScheduler<Split>,
            flash::DynamicPersistentTileScheduler<...>
```

| Scenario | Scheduler | Grid |
|----------|-----------|------|
| Fixed-length, **non-causal** prefill | `StaticPersistentTileScheduler` | `{num_sm}` |
| Fixed-length, **causal/local** prefill | `DynamicPersistentTileScheduler` (LPT-first) | `{num_sm}` |
| Varlen | `VarlenDynamicPersistentTileScheduler` | `{num_sm}` |
| Split without varlen | `SingleTileScheduler` (one CTA per tile) | `{num_blocks, heads×splits, batch}` |

Persistent grid examples:

```167:169:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/tile_scheduler.hpp
    static dim3
    get_grid_shape(Params const& params, int num_sm) {
        return {uint32_t(num_sm)};
```

CTAs loop tiles via `tile_idx + gridDim.x` (static) or semaphore (dynamic).

