## 4. Warpgroups & IntraWG overlap (hd256)

Block layout in `flash_fwd_kernel_sm90.h`:

```76:78:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_fwd_kernel_sm90.h
    static constexpr uint32_t NumLoadWarpGroups = 1;
    static constexpr uint32_t NumMmaWarpGroups = CUTE_STATIC_V(size(TiledMmaPV{})) / cutlass::NumThreadsPerWarpGroup;
    static constexpr uint32_t MaxThreadsPerBlock = CUTE_STATIC_V(size(TiledMmaPV{})) + (NumLoadWarpGroups * cutlass::NumThreadsPerWarpGroup);
```

For hd256 with kBlockM=128: `AtomLayoutQK = Shape<kBlockM/64, _1, _1>` → **2 MMA warpgroups** (256 threads) + **1 producer warpgroup**.

Producer thread count (BF16, no V-transpose):

```124:124:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
    static constexpr int NumProducerThreads = !Transpose_V && Use_TMA_KV && Use_TMA_Q ? cutlass::NumThreadsPerWarp : cutlass::NumThreadsPerWarpGroup;
```

→ **1 warp (32 threads)** for K/V/Q TMA loads; **2 consumer MMA warpgroups**.

**IntraWGOverlap = true** for hd256 (from tile heuristic). Overlap loop in mainloop:

```1212:1256:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
        if constexpr (IntraWGOverlap) {
            ...
            auto fwd_step = [&](int const n_block, auto mask_fn, auto check_inf_type) {
                ...
                flash::gemm</*zero_init=*/true, /*wg_wait=*/-1>(tiled_mma_qk, tSrQ, tSrK(_, _, _, smem_pipe_read.index()), tSrS);
                ...
                flash::gemm</*zero_init=*/false, /*wg_wait=*/-1>(tiled_mma_pv, cute::conditional_return<MmaPV_is_RS>(tOrP, tOsP), tOrV(_, _, _, smem_pipe_read_v.index()), tOrO);
```

This overlaps QK on iter *n*, PV on iter *n−1*, and softmax on iter *n* within the 2 MMA warpgroups.

For hd256 BF16: `UseSchedulerBarrier = false` (needs `kHeadDim <= 128` for non-FP8), but `RescaleOBeforeGemm = true`:

```367:371:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
    static constexpr bool UseSchedulerBarrier = (IntraWGOverlap
        ? (NumMmaWarpGroups >= 2) && (!Is_FP8 ? kHeadDim <= 128 : kHeadDim >= 128)
        : NumMmaWarpGroups == 2)
        && !LargeHeadDimV;
    static constexpr bool RescaleOBeforeGemm = kHeadDim > 128 && (!Is_FP8 || V_colmajor) && IntraWGOverlap;
```

Register budgets (2 MMA WGs, TMA KV):

```86:87:/home/yak/reference_code/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_fwd_kernel_sm90.h
    static constexpr uint32_t LoadRegisterRequirement = NumMmaWarpGroups == 1 ? 56 : (NumMmaWarpGroups == 2 ? (Use_TMA_KV && !ExtraProducerRegsForVarlen ? 24 : 40) : 32);
    static constexpr uint32_t MmaRegisterRequirement = NumMmaWarpGroups == 1 ? 256 : (NumMmaWarpGroups == 2 ? (Use_TMA_KV && !ExtraProducerRegsForVarlen ? 240 : 232) : 160);
```

→ Producer **24 regs**, each MMA WG **240 regs** for standard hd256 prefill.

