## Quick reference matrix (typical fixed-length causal prefill, TMA KV, hd_q = hd_v)

| | hd192 BF16 | hd256 BF16 | hd128 FP8 |
|--|-----------|-----------|-----------|
| kBlockM × kBlockN | 128×96 | 128×80 | 128×192 |
| kStages (K/V) | 2 | 2 | 2 |
| Q smem | single buffer | single buffer | single buffer |
| MMA warpgroups | 2 | 2 | 2 |
| Producer | 1 warp | 1 warp | 1 warpgroup (transpose) |
| IntraWGOverlap | yes | yes | yes |
| MmaPV | RS (P in regs) | RS | RS |
| Scheduler | DynamicPersistent | DynamicPersistent | DynamicPersistent |
| Grid | ≈ num SMs | ≈ num SMs | ≈ num SMs |
| O writeback | reg→smem→TMA | reg→smem→TMA | reg→smem→TMA (+ col unpermute) |

